# Public HTTPS URL only, after the receiving service and recipient are approved.
# No passwords or secret API keys. POST FormData: name, email, message, _gotcha.
# Must return JSON {"ok":true} or {"success":true} only after accepting the message.
# Receiver must allow this site's origin (CORS), validate all fields server-side,
# reject abuse (rate limits/honeypot), and keep delivery credentials private.
PUBLIC_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=
